body:
@x-yuri thanks for all the info. This is odd... What I see here, is that with your Arch Linux you're using one of the most recent versions of OpenSSH ([version 6.7](http://www.openssh.com/txt/release-6.7) was released on October 6, 2014). Ubuntu 14.04 is using `6.6p1`, Homebrew for Mac provides `6.6.p1_1`.

What VM provider are you using actually? KVM? Virtualbox?

I reopen this issue and flag it to `hosts/arch` for now. I would recommend to search and ask with Arch community as well (https://wiki.archlinux.org/index.php/Vagrant, https://bbs.archlinux.org/search.php)
